# ============================================================
# 011_Project_Control_Stress.R
#
# Objective 2
# Cohort-referenced robust normalisation of the independent
# Control and Stress populations.
#
# For every Author x behavioural variable:
#   1. the median and raw MAD are estimated exclusively from the
#      controls of that Author in Objective 1;
#   2. MAD_scaled = 1.4826 x MAD_raw;
#   3. the same median and MAD_scaled are applied unchanged to
#      Control and Stress fish from that Author;
#   4. cohorts are combined only after normalisation.
#
# Definitive transformation:
#   (x - Median_control_Author) /
#     (1.4826 * MAD_raw_control_Author)
# ============================================================

